    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Rotary Position Embeddings Implementation</para>
<para>Implements rotation-based positional encoding for transformer models, adapted for use in ThemisDB&apos;s vector storage layer. Enables:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Positional awareness for sequential entities</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Relational embeddings for knowledge graph operations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Temporal encoding for time-series data</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Multi-relational vector search</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Sources:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>RoFormer Paper: Su, J., et al. (2021). arXiv:2104.09864</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Original Concept: Rotary Position Embedding (RoPE)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>ThemisDB Integration: ThemisDB Core Team </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
